SUMMARY:One Piece: Pirates Party
DESCRIPTION:🏴‍☠️ Join CCS and Luffy’s Corner for One Piece: Pirates Party! Whether you’re new to the ONE PIECE CARD GAME or just looking for a fun\, casual night with fellow NAKAMA\, come play\, meet the community\, and enjoy pirate battles without the pressure of meta decks! \nThis event will cap at 44 players\, so sign up while supplies last! \n  \n🗓️ : July 17th\, 2026 \n📍: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \n📝 Event Overview: \n\nFormat: Constructed\nTournament Structure: Single Elimination\nExpected Number of Rounds: 4 rounds\nEntry: $5\nOn-Site Registration\n\n  \n💰 Prize Pool: \n\nParticipation: Bandai Participation Pack\n\n  \n📋 Registration Details: \n\nDoors Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site Registration: 6:00 PM\nRound 1 Begins: 7:00 PM\n\n  \nAdditional Information:\nLeaders not Allowed:\nOP05-098 Enel (Yellow)\nOP09-001 Shanks (Red)\nOP11-041 Nami (Blue/Yellow)\nOP12-061 Donquixote Rosinante (Purple/Yellow)\nOP13-001 Monkey.D.Luffy (Red/Green)\nOP13-002 Portgas.D.Ace (Red/Blue)\nOP13-079 Imu (Black)\nOP14-020 Dracule Mihawk (Green)\nOP14-041 Boa Hancock (Blue/Yellow)\nOP15-002 Lucy (Red/Blue)\nOP15-058 Enel (Purple)\nOP15-098 Monkey.D.Luffy (Yellow)\nOP16-022 Monkey.D.Luffy (Green/Blue)\nOP16-079 Yamato (Black)\nOP16-080 Marshall.D.Teach (Black/Yellow)
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/one-piece-pirates-party/
CATEGORIES:Trading Card Game
