DESCRIPTION:⚔️ Join CCS and Omega Gaming for the Riftbound: Vendetta Pre-Rift Pre-Release! Be among the first to crack open the new set\, learn the latest cards and mechanics\, and battle alongside fellow players before the official release. Spots are limited\, so secure your seat and prepare for Vendetta!\nCapped at 32 players\, so enter while supplies last! \n  \n🗓️ : July 24\, 2026 \n📍: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nEvent Overview: \n\nFormat: Sealed\nTournament Structure: Swiss Rounds\nExpected Number of Rounds: 3\nEntry: $25\nRegistration 👉 https://locator.riftbound.uvsgames.com/events/659498\n\n  \n📋 Registration Details: \n\nDoors Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site Registration: 6:00 PM\nRound 1 Begins: 7:00 PM
