SUMMARY:Artist Alley Houston IV
DESCRIPTION:Artist Alley Houston IV – Every Piece Has a Story Behind It\nSomewhere in Houston\, an artist is finishing a print\, packing pins\, sewing a plushie\, or putting the final touches on a project they’ve been excited to share for months. \nThis October\, those creations leave the studio and head to Artist Alley Houston IV. \nFor one weekend\, artists\, makers\, and independent creators from across Texas and beyond will fill the floor with original artwork\, fan creations\, handmade goods\, indie comics\, stickers\, plushies\, accessories\, and all the things that start as an idea and become someone’s new favorite piece. \n  \n📅 October 10-11 | 10AM – 5PM \n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🎨 100+ Artists and Makers\nThe best part? The artist is right there. Ask about their process. Talk about the fandoms that inspired them. Meet the people behind the work and discover creators you’ll be following long after the weekend ends. No AI-generated artwork. No mass-produced imports. Just artists sharing the work they’ve created themselves. \n  \n✨ Exclusive Drops and Event Debuts\nMany artists are launching event-only merch\, limited bundles\, brand-new releases\, and first-time debuts created specifically for Artist Alley Houston III. You won’t find these anywhere else\, online or in stores. \n  \n🛍️ Become a Guest Vendor\nHouston creators – this floor is yours. Applications are open for table spots at Artist Alley Houston IV. Every vendor is juried to keep the floor 100% original and handmade. Apply Here → https://tinyurl.com/HoustonVendors \n  \n🎁 FREE Artist Raffle \nWin original art\, stickers\, keychains\, handmade goods\, and more — generously donated by our featured artists. No purchase necessary. Just stop by\, sign up\, and celebrate the joy of creativity (and maybe go home with something awesome). 🎁✨ \n  \n🏨 Staying the Weekend?\nA hotel block is available for out-of-town visitors and creators making the trip. \nBook here 👉🏻 https://www.marriott.com/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \n  \nDiscover a new favorite artist. Discover a piece that speaks to you. Discover the story behind the work. \nWe’ll see you on the floor. 🎨✨
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/artist-alley-houston-iv/
CATEGORIES:Anime
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Banner.png
END:VEVENT
